{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3184620/extras/73c6e98d8f27ba9bc5e470a744871e93.webp?t=1768433006\" width=352 height=58 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Roguelike Deckbuilding</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Build your Deck of Cards to unleash insane tactical synergies.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Enemies may also use Cards from their Deck.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3184620/extras/6ee48d0a2c771001f6291ada3d2eebf8.poster.avif?t=1768433006\" width=616 height=346 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3184620/extras/6ee48d0a2c771001f6291ada3d2eebf8.webm?t=1768433006\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3184620/extras/6ee48d0a2c771001f6291ada3d2eebf8.mp4?t=1768433006\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Grid-based Tactics &amp; Telegraphed Attacks.</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >AP-based Cards with Turn-based Tactics on a grid.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Enemies Telegraphed Attacks preview their intended Actions and Attack-Order.\u00a0</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use Crowd-Control effects such as Flip, Pin, Push, Pull, Provoke &amp; Mind-control or Place/Manipulate surrounding Objects/Terrain/Traps to dominate the Battle-Grid.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Control a party of multiple units.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Made a mistake? Rewind your Turn, Rewind your Loot, Rewind your Encounter!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Satisfying Fast-paced Turn Ha